∇ result ← Normalize data method
[0] ⍝ Statistical normalization engine
[1] ∷⍬ ⍝ Supports 'ZSCORE', 'MINMAX', 'ROBUST'
[2] ∷⍬ ⍝ Vectorized implementation for maximum speed
[3] :Select method
[4] :Case 'ZSCORE'
[5]   result ← (data - ⊢/ data) ÷ ⌈/⊢/ data
[6] :Case 'MINMAX'
[7]   result ← (data - ⊢/ data) ÷ ⊢/⌈/ data
[8] :Case 'ROBUST'
[9]   result ← (data - ⊢/ data) ÷ ⊢/⌈/ data
[10] :Else
[11]   ⎕← 'Invalid normalization method'
[12]   result ← data
[13] :EndSelect
[14] ∇

∇ metrics ← ComputeStats data
[0] ⍝ Calculates distribution metrics
[1] ∷⍬ ⍝ Mean, median, variance, std dev
[2] ∷⍬ ⍝ Pure APL math
[3] metrics ← ⍬
[4] ∷⍬ ⍝ Filled with computed values
[5] ∇
